          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Available in six configurations</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Three distinct repair strand color options exist to offer easy identification intra-operatively.</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Offered in 1.4mm and 2.3mm sizes</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Color coded sutures clearly distinguish the #2 repair suture from the #2-0 shuttle suture for ease of use.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 03 2024 15:46:15 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "5",
          "showDimensionalBox": "true",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
